        "fq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why somna",
            "a": "<p>The nasal strip that opens your airway the moment it goes on—so you breathe through your nose all night and the room stays quiet. Somna opens your nasal passages so you breathe easier through the night, helping reduce snoring and making it easier to wake up feeling more refreshed.</p><ul><li>Opens your nasal passages so you breathe easier through the night</li><li>Quieter nights — less snoring, less mouth-breathing, no dry mouth</li><li>Wake up clearer and more rested</li><li>Drug-free and non-invasive — nothing to swallow, nothing to charge</li><li>Stays put all night — sweat-resistant even for restless sleepers</li><li>Hypoallergenic, latex-free, dermatologically tested</li><li><strong>Designed for Better Sleep — Made for Everyday Routines</strong><br/><br/></li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "fq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Shipping & Returns",
            "a": "<p>We ship fast, worldwide.</p><ul><li>Delivery: 7-9 business days</li><li>Express: 2-5 business days</li><li>Tracking provided on all orders</li><li>Ships from local EU or US warehouses for speed & reliability</li></ul><p>See our return policy for more information.</p><p>You'll get an email with tracking info as soon as your order leaves the building. Fast, reliable, and ready when you are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fq3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will this stop my snoring",
            "a": "<p>Snoring often happens when you can't get enough air through your nose, forcing you to mouth-breathe. Strips. gently lifts your nasal passages open so more air flows through your nose — the way you're built to breathe. Many users notice quieter nights from the very first use, though results vary from person to person. And if you don't feel the difference within 30 nights, it's free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fq4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What makes somna different from other nasal strips",
            "a": "<ul><li>Opens your airway more effectively than drugstore strips — and it's reusable-grade adhesive, not a flimsy band-aid</li><li>Premium adhesive that stays put through a full night's sleep (and a workout, if you're into that)</li><li>Sleek matte \"bolt\" design — finally a strip that doesn't look medical</li><li>Resealable pouch, 30 strips per pack</li><li>Drug-free, latex-free, dermatologically tested</li><li><strong>Made for Better Sleep — Built for Everyday Use<br/></strong><br/></li></ul>"
          }
        },
